    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27153.png",
      "text": "ባጃጅ ንመጓዓዝያ እተገልግል ባዓል ሰለስተ ጎማ ንእሽተይ ተሽከርካሪት እያ።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:cd3fd255a56f8d6c7c92b59234174180665d5983e37a33257d107a84f681abeb"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27152.png",
      "text": "ኣብ ሕብረተሰብና ኣሽከርካሪነት ብደቂ ተባዕትዮ ዝተዓብለለ ዘፈር ስራሕ እዩ። ቡዙሕ ግዜ ደቂ ኣንስትዮ ኣይሳተፋሉን።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:5dcb5d926e1fbb24e34cf8ae8e4a9147aff836e7fa8a0acda4ee8e5f65a490ab"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27154.png",
      "text": "ካብ ዕለታት ሓደ መዓልቲ አበበች ናይ መዘወሪ መንጃ ፍቓድ ንምምሃር ካብ ቤተሰባ ገንዘብ ጠየቐት፡፡ ቤተሰባ ግን \"እዙይ እማ ንጋል ኣነስተይቲ ጽቡቕ ስራሕ ኣይኮነን፥ ሰብከ እንታይ ይብለኪ?\" በልዋ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e243d9d95863f71d8836a1b9ab6cf293984287ba3a47126d65aa752398e02c3f"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27155.png",
      "text": "ንሳ \"ሰብ ዝሰርሖ ኩሉ ከም ዝኾነ ሰብ ናይ ምስራሕ ዓቕሚ ኣለኒ\" ብምባል ኣእመነቶም፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:4e422bf61be18dcbc2a00f0553edd7f0574b1a7316537bf3950047520587a7ee"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27149.png",
      "text": "ስልጠና እዉን ብግቡእ ተኸታቲላ ወደአት። ቤተሰባ ድማ እንታይ ንግበረላ ኢሎም ተማኸሩ።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:7d3c11797ff1871d83e7ba49c8ccad827c289f4754d20b2226fc58facf1ae253"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27145.png",
      "text": "ካብኡ ባጃጅ ክገዝኡላ ወሲኖም፡፡ አበበች ኣብ ደብረ ብርሃን ጎደናታት ባጃጅ ምሽክርካር ጀመረት።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1ef6051919159bfed6e501617b80327908645029230de21827456380c4599969"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27148.png",
      "text": "ካብ ዕለታት ሓደ ማዓልቲ ሓደ ጽቡቕ ሓሳብ ናብ አዕምሮኣ መጸላ፡፡ ኣብ ድሕሪ ባጃጃ ስልኪ ቁጽራ ዝተሓተመሉ ዓብይ ምልክታ ለጢፋ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e0c87aca0ef8a1f0af0e7dae6e8f088f7c819b97732d9ca4f096732e380f83aa"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27150.png",
      "text": "ምልክታ ከምዙይ ይብል፡- \"ነፍሰ ጹር ኣንስቲ፣ ሓራሳት ኣዴታትን ህጻዉንትን ብነፃ ነብጽሕ\"፡፡ ካብኡ ዝወልዳ ኣዴታት ደቀን ዝሓመምወን ናብ አበበች ይድዉላ፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6fa4bb2d65d49220fc031dc4db775e49b092330c7b6905040dd696cbee8a5352"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27151.png",
      "text": "ባጃጅ እንዳዘወረት ገንዘብ ኣከበት፡፡ ጽቡቕ ስራሕ ምስራሕ ቀጸለትሉ፡፡እኹል ኣታዊ ንዘየብሎም ድኻታት እዉን ብነፃ ምግልጋል ጀመረት።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:2e6dd84bddc2b74cda6aeff71c70ea83490082cd06a2be5c012cc2af46ada24d"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": null,
      "text": "ኣበበች ብዙይ ስራሓ ብገንዘብ ዘይትመን ዕግበት ረኺባ። ዓበይቲ ሰባት መሪቖማ። ብህጻዉንትን ወለዳን እዉን ብጣዕሚ እትፍቶ ሰብ ኮነት። አበበች ‹‹ጽቡቕ ምስራሕ ንባዕልኻ እዩ ትብል››፡፡",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=25986#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:94f4ed4ebdec4de46bcd29be529d9843de22e54159e6775f8807c16125edb751"
    }
  ],
